cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "shap-svg: interactive SVG charts for SHAP explanations"
abstract: >-
  shap-svg draws SHAP explanations as interactive SVG charts in the browser,
  from the SHAP values themselves rather than pre-rendered images. It follows
  the layout and colours of the SHAP library's own plots and has a
  framework-free core with React components.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pongsutiyakorn
    given-names: Pongsakorn
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/princepongsakorn/shap-svg"
url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/shap-svg"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: "2026-10-14"
keywords:
  - SHAP
  - explainable AI
  - data visualization
  - SVG
  - React
